---
title: Hot rooms
---
On a map of rooms, the route says which rooms a player has to pass through and which are optional [[t:267-269 s:30]].

## The rule
1. Find the route from the start to the exit [[c21:131]].
2. A room is on the route when a step of the route falls inside it [[c21:132-141]].
3. Highlight the rooms on the route, and gray the rest [[c21:131-154]].

- **Talk says,** of the gray rooms: cull them for a room-to-room game, or hide bonus things in them [[t:269-271]].
- **Talk says,** of the rooms on the route: order a story along them, since the player will probably pass through them in order [[t:274-276 s:31]].

